                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. A sub-committee of the Commonwealth's Joint Labor-Management Committee, consisting of four (4) people desi gnated by MOSES and four (4) people designated by the Personnel Administrator, shall meet and develop mutually agreed upon policies and implementation procedures for an Alternative Dispute Resolution Program which may include an option for mediation or a binding tri-partite panel at the Step III grievance level.",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                522,
                1081,
                689
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    522.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    522.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    689.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    689.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. Furthermore, the committee shall meet bi-monthly to review the Commonwealth's grievance procedure, review training needs related to the grievance procedure and to review individual labor-management proposals jointly submitted by the agency and MOSES representatives regarding alternative dispute resolution pilot programs, training needs and possible improvements to the efficiency of the grievance procedure.",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                713,
                1079,
                880
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    713.0
                ],
                [
                    1079.0,
                    713.0
                ],
                [
                    1079.0,
                    880.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    880.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. At, or following the Step III stage of the grievance procedure and in certain designated Agencies, Alternative Dispute Resolution (ADR) pilot programs shall be developed with a goal for initial implementation within six(6) months from the signing date of the Agreement. ADR Programs may include, but shall not be limited to mediation, an oral Step 1 grievance and review committee.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                906,
                1074,
                1046
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    906.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    906.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    1046.0
                ],
